    "en": "Story relay",
    "descriptionZh": "和 Camille 轮流接一两句，把故事讲下去。",
    "descriptionEn": "Take turns adding one or two sentences to a shared story.",
    "howZh": "保留已经发生的情节，每次增加一两句；可以说“结束故事”来收尾。没有标准答案。",
    "howEn": "Keep earlier events consistent and add one or two sentences per turn. Ask to end the story when ready. There is no single right answer.",
